              "type": "text",
              "text": "<p><strong><strong>TICKET OPTIONS:</strong></strong></p><p><strong><strong>Free Pass: </strong></strong>Excludes lunch &amp; after-Show drinks</p><p><strong><strong>Day Pass: </strong></strong>Includes buffet lunch and after-Show networking drinks</p><p><strong><strong>Seminar Pass:</strong></strong> Includes all with Day Pass as well as 4 seminar sessions during the day.</p><p><br></p><p>TO VIEW THE SEMINARS, PLEASE SCROLL DOWN AND CLICK ON THE AGENDA!</p><p><br></p><p><strong><strong>“</strong></strong><strong><strong>Immerse yourself in inspiring seminars, fresh ideas, and meaningful connections that will transform the way you work. This is where the future of office management begins - and you’ll want to be part of it</strong></strong><strong><strong>.”</strong></strong></p><p><br></p><p>You're invited to join us for <strong><strong>The Office Management Show</strong></strong> on <strong><strong>Friday 25th September 2026</strong></strong> at the <a href=\"https://www.themayfairhotel.co.uk/about-us\" title=\"https://www.themayfairhotel.co.uk/about-us\" target=\"_blank\" data-msys-clicktrack=\"0\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><strong><strong>The May Fair Hotel</strong></strong></a>.</p><p><br></p><p><em><em>This one-day event is designed to help you:</em></em></p><ul><li>Run your office with greater ease and confidence</li><li>Gain new skills and insights to enhance your career</li><li>Connect with like-minded Office Management professionals</li></ul><p>Whether you pop in for a few hours or stay with us for the full day, you’ll leave with practical ideas, fresh support, and valuable connections.</p><p><br></p><p>📅 <strong><strong>Event Highlights</strong></strong></p><ul><li>Doors to the exhibition open at 09:30am</li><li>Choice of free or paid passes to suit your day</li><li>Engaging seminars, expert advice, and networking opportunities</li></ul><p><br></p><p>🎟 <strong><strong>Tickets</strong></strong></p><ul><li>Free or Day Pass tickets available (see ticket information for detail)</li><li>Add a <strong><strong>Seminar </strong></strong><strong><strong>P</strong></strong><strong><strong>ass </strong></strong>as an upgrade to access these</li><li>You do <strong><strong>not</strong></strong> need to be a Portal Member to attend</li><li>Premium Members enjoy extra discounts on all ticket types (find out more at <a href=\"www.theofficemanagementportal.com/packages\" title=\"www.theofficemanagementportal.com/packages\" target=\"_blank\" data-msys-clicktrack=\"0\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">www.theofficemanagementportal.com/packages</a>)</li></ul><p><br></p><p>📩 Questions? Contact us at <a href=\"\" title=\"\" target=\"_blank\" data-msys-clicktrack=\"0\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><strong><strong>contact@theofficemanagementgroup.com</strong></strong></a></p>",
