              "type": "text",
              "text": "<p><em><strong><strong>Seminar Sessions:</strong></strong></em><em><em> there is a </em></em><em><strong><strong>£50 fee for a seminar pass for non-Premium Portal Members and a £25 fee for Premium Portal Members, </strong></strong></em><em><em>w</em></em><em><em>hich </em></em><em><em>will enable you to attend as many as you wish throughout the day and receive those that are recorded after the Show.</em></em></p><p><em><em>Please ensure you book on using the Add-Ons button - spaces are limited. All seminar sessions are 45 minutes in length with Q&amp;A time included. Often, on the day we do have tickets available and you can purchase these on the door per seminar or a day ticket</em></em></p><p><br></p><p><strong><strong>Please do not register to attend</strong></strong> if you are not in an office, facilities or workplace management or administrative/assistant or have office management duties in your role, as your ticket will be cancelled. If you wish to connect with delegates, you will need to purchase a stand. Partners of the OMP are not eligible to attend any part of the Show, unless they have purchased an exhibitor stand.</p><p><br></p><p><strong><strong>PLEASE NOTE: </strong></strong>Refunds are not possible on any purchased tickets for those who cancel or no show due to limited availability. Seminar sessions will be recorded for those who permit us to, and shared within <a href=\"https://www.theofficemanagementportal.com\" title=\"https://www.theofficemanagementportal.com\" target=\"_blank\" data-msys-clicktrack=\"0\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><strong><strong>The Office Management Portal</strong></strong></a> for our Premium Members, and to those who purchased tickets within 1 month after the Show.</p><p><em><em>Seminar sessions will be announced soon - there will be four during the day either side of the lunch break.</em></em></p>",
