                      "title": "Office Management Workshop hosted by Hana Gray & Ashlin Pugh",
                      "startTime": "11:30",
                      "endTime": "12:15",
                      "description": "Join Hana Gray and Ashlin Pugh from Headline Sponsors Chapman & Carter, for an interactive workshop where the conversation is shaped by the people in the room.\n\nTogether you'll explore the challenges, trends and opportunities shaping Office Management today, sharing ideas, experiences and practical solutions with professionals who truly understand the role.\n\nWhether the discussion turns to AI, hybrid working, budgets, workplace culture or something none of us saw coming, you'll leave with fresh perspectives, practical ideas and new connections.\n\nBecause sometimes the most valuable conversations aren't planned.\n\nThey're the ones that happen when you bring the right people together.",
