                      "title": "Competing Priorities, Shifting Deadlines Zero Time: 3 Frameworks to Prioritise",
                      "startTime": "13:30",
                      "endTime": "14:15",
                      "description": "Everything lands on your desk - competing priorities, last-minute requests, shifting deadlines. You're juggling it all, and yet, the important work still hasn't moved forward. \n\nYou need to know where to focus when everything feels urgent.\n\nIn this session, you'll learn three practical frameworks that help you audit your time, adapt your energy, and make intentional decisions about where your focus goes. These are tools I developed over 20 years of police leadership in high-pressure environments and refined through years of working with professionals who are brilliant at delivering results but exhausted from constant firefighting.\n\nYou'll leave with frameworks you can apply immediately and a downloadable workbook to map your own time.",
